      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-81663",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/ba/ba24fd9222bee2083ae7c104eb0dfc63493e0e27cfc60acff5176b1d2d06d990.png)\n\nConsider the region bounded by the curve $y = x^{3}$ and the horizontal line $y =-1$ from $x = 0$ to $x = 1$, as shown in the picture. Calculate the volume of the solid generated when that region is rotated $2\u03c0$ radians about the line $y =-1$.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
